      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "戦うのは辛いけど\r\n私もレインたちを助けないとならないの。",
        "official_en": "It won’t be easy fighting you, but I need to help Rain, too.",
        "real_en": "It hurts to fight you, but I have to help Rain and the others."
