      "text": {
        "jp": "戦わない方法はないのかと言いたいところじゃが……。\r\nそれがあったら姉さんもやられてはいないだろうしな。",
        "official_en": "Judging from the thrashing he gave sister dearest... ’Tis clear that there shall be no resolution without a fight.",
        "real_en": "I wish there were a way to avoid fighting... But if there were, my sister wouldn’t have been defeated either."
